    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Break through obstacles using your <strong><i><u>jumps</u></i></strong> and powerful <strong><i><u>skills</u></i></strong>!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Color follows function&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every color in the game holds unique symbolism and functionality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 <strong><i><u>Green</u></i></strong> represents elevation and ascent. Use the green skill with triple jump to reach higher and farther places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/c3f856cd6e7e711535bb077cd027d21b.poster.avif?t=1752128822\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/c3f856cd6e7e711535bb077cd027d21b.webm?t=1752128822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/c3f856cd6e7e711535bb077cd027d21b.mp4?t=1752128822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd35 <strong><i><u>Blue</u></i></strong> embodies speed. Dash forward to travel faster and cover more distance. Combine it with a triple jump to clear long obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/9cc5f717642f5b6cc44b7632b0c9bba3.poster.avif?t=1752128822\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/9cc5f717642f5b6cc44b7632b0c9bba3.webm?t=1752128822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/9cc5f717642f5b6cc44b7632b0c9bba3.mp4?t=1752128822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe1 <strong><i><u>Yellow</u></i></strong> signifies gliding. Use this skill to float farther with reduced gravity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/541785ae8f70d88eb5f634fae98b600e.poster.avif?t=1752128822\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/541785ae8f70d88eb5f634fae98b600e.webm?t=1752128822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/541785ae8f70d88eb5f634fae98b600e.mp4?t=1752128822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc97 <strong><i><u>Pink</u></i></strong> allows you to reshape the world. Transform terrain and obstacles to your advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/8793aa83b1fc995fb50cf5b73d7eb3c5.poster.avif?t=1752128822\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/8793aa83b1fc995fb50cf5b73d7eb3c5.webm?t=1752128822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/8793aa83b1fc995fb50cf5b73d7eb3c5.mp4?t=1752128822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26ab <strong><i><u>Black</u></i></strong> grants a shield. While it's active, you won\u2019t sway from obstacles. When it breaks, it propels you upward\u2014use it for an extra boost! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/39fd5955886dec52403acf864969f0a0.poster.avif?t=1752128822\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/39fd5955886dec52403acf864969f0a0.webm?t=1752128822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/39fd5955886dec52403acf864969f0a0.mp4?t=1752128822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf08 Many more colors await, each with their own skills, environments, and items.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Red, pink, orange, yellow, green, turquoise, blue, purple, brown, white, gray, black... and finally, rainbow.</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/88b87b6f21f7207fdabcf9dc0ebeb90c.poster.avif?t=1752128822\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/88b87b6f21f7207fdabcf9dc0ebeb90c.webm?t=1752128822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/88b87b6f21f7207fdabcf9dc0ebeb90c.mp4?t=1752128822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the unique powers of each color. Understanding and mastering them is your key <strong><i><u>challenge</u></i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca8 <strong>Challenge yourself in the world of Lumen, where the wind never stops blowing.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/20efbad343266e0150f35a78b7993bfa.poster.avif?t=1752128822\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/20efbad343266e0150f35a78b7993bfa.webm?t=1752128822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792930/extras/20efbad343266e0150f35a78b7993bfa.mp4?t=1752128822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are '<strong>Phantom'</strong>, a challenger navigating the skies aboard the flying vessel '<strong>Blask'</strong>, conquering each '<strong>Wind Zone'</strong> one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is your choice?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cTo overcome the wind,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The reed bends,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The tree withstands,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>But the spear and arrow pierce it.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blask is known as <i>\u201c<strong><u>The Spear of Lumen.</u></strong>\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phantom is called <i>\u201c<strong><u>The Arrow of Lumen.</u></strong>\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you, too, carry the will to pierce the wind...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New challengers are always welcome.</strong></h2>",
